        "summary": "END TO END (all paths are under C:\\Users\\Jeison\\Documents\\GitHub\\AoE3-Mod-Launcher\\WarsOfLibertyLauncher\\).\n\nENTRY POINTS. The gear menu wires MenuRepairInstall/MenuVerifyFiles (MainWindow.xaml.cs:204,206). Mod Properties goes through the same handlers via RaiseMenuClick (MainWindow.xaml.cs:5363-5364). MenuRepairInstall_Click (9836-9848) bails for IsStockGame or a missing install, then calls RepairInstallAsync(). MenuVerifyFiles_Click (9850-9855) forwards to VerifyButton_Click (7677-7789). Repair is enabled only for WolPatcher/GitHubReleases (13481-13484); Verify is enabled for any installed mod (13496).\n\nVERIFY FILES. VerifyButton_Click creates _operatingCts, hides Pause, sets Retry to RepairInstallAsync() (7692-7702), then runs VerifyInstallation(..., hashPass:true, token) on Task.Run (7741-7743). VerifyInstallation (10102-10298) runs these checks in order:\n(a) probe file exists;\n(b) the 3 data\\ key files exist (WolPatcher/GitHubReleases only);\n(c) WolPatcher-only structure: art\\zulushield, data, sound, AI3; data\\*.bar >=1 KB; sound >=5 files;\n(d) if the manifest has FileHashes: VerifyService.VerifyAgainstManifest (parallel, max(4) threads, size first, then SHA-256), then VerifyEngineFiles (sequential, suffixed \"reinstall the base game\"), then FindUnexpectedFiles (log only, first 50);\n(e) otherwise a random sample of 200 files checked only for zero bytes.\nAny problem shows ShowProgressError with Retry=Repair (7770); cancel shows ShowProgressCancelled (7772-7776).\n\nREPAIR (RepairInstallAsync 8006-8593). Guards: _isBusy, CanResolvePayload, EnsureGameNotRunning (8010-8031). A new NativeInstallService is created (8054). plainRepair = !asUpdate && targetReleaseTag==null (8158).\n- Branch A, plain repair whose manifest has FileHashes (8170-8227): pre-verify runs VerifyAgainstManifest only (8185-8188; no engine or structural checks).\n  - 0 damaged: intact=true, no download (8190-8196).\n  - >=1 damaged: EnsureInstallWritableOrElevate, ConfirmRepairSpaceOk, EnsurePayloadAsync, then InstallModOnlyAsync of the WHOLE payload at ResolveInstallVersion(null) (8205-8225). For GitHubReleases that is EffectiveGitHubTag, i.e. approved/latest, not the installed tag (10341-10343, 10434-10437).\n- Branch B, update / version pick / manifest without FileHashes (8228-8390): elevate, optional delta chain (ResolveDeltaTarget returns null for a plain repair), otherwise the full InstallModOnlyAsync or the baseline rescue.\n- Tail after the branches (8392-8503):\n  - recheck: nothing for intact; otherwise VerifyInstallation(hashPass:false), a structural check plus a random zero-byte sample (8399-8409).\n  - ReapplyAddonsAfterOverlayAsync and ApplyUserDataPayloadAsync ALWAYS run, including when intact and before the pass/fail test (8418-8427).\n  - On success: stamp LastKnownVersion = laidDownVersion (also when intact), pin logic for version picks, bell, TryCleanupTemp (8429-8496).\n  - On failure: StatusRepairPartial. The manifest was already rewritten and LastKnownVersion is not stamped.\n  - Catches: cancel, SetupPathKeyAccess, SetupPathPatch, generic (8505-8530). finally resets the UI (8531-8536).\n- After finally: an update runs translation ReconcileAfterUpdate + CheckAsync (8540-8567). A plain repair runs CheckAsync and auto-continues into pending WolPatcher downloads (8573-8592). A plain repair never reconciles translations.\n\nINSTALLMODONLYASYNC (NativeInstallService.cs:523-640).\n1. Download all parts to %TEMP%\\...\\native-install; SHA pins are checked only if present (875-993).\n2. Staged payloads: extract the whole zip to temp and check files still exist (1071-1170). Direct payloads: ValidatePayloadZip checks only the central directory (1341-1355).\n3. Load previousManifest (582). Overwrite the install in place: staged = File.Copy(overwrite) per file, ct checked between files, hashing the TEMP source (1682-1797); direct = FileMode.Create per entry, ct checked inside the write loop, hash recorded after close (1383-1549). No backup and no rollback.\n4. Delete the zip (590). ApplyUpdateDeletions (GitHubReleases re-overlay only, backed up in <install>\\_upd_delete_backup) or StripDeleteListArtifact (598-604). Opt-in XMB/clone cleanup (610-611). ClassifyOverlay (sticky; 1808-1831). ApplyPrivateSetupPath, which re-hashes the patched exe (618, 2566-2576).\n5. CreateShortcuts and WriteRegistryEntries with installLabel=null (623-624).\n6. WriteManifest(aoe3SourcePath:null, clonedAoe3:false, installLabel:null, ...) (626-628). It builds a BRAND-NEW manifest: Files/Directories = the whole folder (2605, 2702-2729); FileHashes = captured hashes, pruned for missing files (2611); KeyFileHashes = MD5 of the 3 live key files (2640); EngineFileHashes = the 7 EngineCandidates minus overlay-owned ones (2642, 1865-1886); only the UserData* fields are carried forward (2644-2647). Save is File.WriteAllText (InstallManifest.cs:294-302) and any failure is swallowed (2655-2658).\n7. RefreshOriginalsSnapshot for mods with translations (632-636).\n\nOnly ApplyGitHubDeltaAsync (652-810) has backup, rollback and post-verify, and it preserves Aoe3SourcePath, ClonedAoe3 and Shortcuts (794-797).",
