        "invariants": [
          "Overlay and engine stay separate: a file is never in both FileHashes and EngineFileHashes, and engine damage is never routed into the overlay repair set (NativeInstallService.cs:1879, 1946-1947; MainWindow.xaml.cs:10242-10253; VerifyServiceTests.Engine_DamagedFlagged_AndNotInOverlayVerify, RecaptureHashes_*).",
          "Covered/translation files are verified and hashed against translations\\_originals (canonical English) via ResolveHashTarget. With no snapshot, the file's existence is confirmed but its hash is skipped. Hashes are captured BEFORE a translation applies, and the delta path restores canonical English before WriteManifest (VerifyService.cs:108-117, 179-185; NativeInstallService.cs:744-771).",
          "PruneMissingHashes is mandatory after any deletion (WriteManifest 2611, UpdateService.cs:1006, AddonService.cs:270). Otherwise Verify reports false missing files and repair resurrects stripped files.",
          "A hash is committed only after the output stream is CLOSED (direct path, NativeInstallService.cs:1499-1504). Otherwise a failed flush leaves the manifest describing bytes that never reached disk.",
          "VerifyExtractIntact runs after extraction and before the overlay copy (NativeInstallService.cs:1162, 1545, 1697). Payload files quarantined by antivirus must abort, not install silently.",
          "A best-effort delta always has a full fallback. ResolveDeltaTarget returns null for a plain repair. The delta chain commits the manifest and LastKnownVersion per hop, and a baseline rescue stamps the baseline tag, never the target (MainWindow.xaml.cs:7797-7870, 8360-8363, 8436-8445; DeltaPatchTests.cs:121-159).",
          "An InPlaceOverlay must never be stamped ClonedAoe3=true, and uninstall vetoes blanket deletion of a real AoE3 root regardless of the manifest (CLAUDE.md:990-1011; UninstallService.cs:165-197, 347-348). Any carry-forward of ClonedAoe3 must keep that veto as its backstop.",
          "WriteManifest builds a fresh manifest each time and must carry forward the fields no phase can rediscover (today UserDataRoot/Files/Dirs/RootCreated at NativeInstallService.cs:2613-2647). Any new identity field needs the same treatment.",
          "The ApplyUpdateDeletions auto-delete targets ONLY net-new files (sticky ClassifyOverlay); base-shadowing files are removed only via an explicit delete.lst; every target is clamped to the install root and backed up (NativeInstallService.cs:1972-2015, 2236-2271, 1808-1831).",
          "Private setup path: the patched exe's fingerprint must be re-captured after patching, or Verify flags it and Repair lays the unpatched exe back (NativeInstallService.cs:2562-2576). Any skip-write or granular path must still re-run ApplyPrivateSetupPath.",
          "The launcher is byte-faithful: nothing is stripped by default (RemoveStaleBuildArtifacts is a no-op, NativeInstallService.cs:394-404). Compiled-XMB and clone-file removal are opt-in and IsolatedFolder-only (2127-2129, 2189-2190).",
          "Addons are re-applied after any re-lay and BEFORE the success report, and ReapplyAllAsync discards stale backups first (MainWindow.xaml.cs:8414-8418; AddonService.cs:289-313). The discard is only correct for files that were actually re-laid.",
          "The Repair bell is raised BEFORE the post-operation CheckAsync so the reconciliation backstop deduplicates (MainWindow.xaml.cs:8479-8483).",
          "Writes need the elevation/space prompts only on paths that write; an intact plain repair must never prompt (MainWindow.xaml.cs:8200-8208, 8230-8235).",
          "Repair progress UI mirrors InstallAsync: phase weights DL60/EX20/OV20 (direct: 60/0/40), phase-aware speed keys, and a phaseProgress reset (MainWindow.xaml.cs:8060-8147; CLAUDE.md:733-756).",
          "The stock game is never verified or repaired (MainWindow.xaml.cs:9841, 9853). Repair is enabled only for WolPatcher/GitHubReleases (13481-13484).",
          "Verify results are sorted Ordinal (parallel determinism, VerifyService.cs:214-217). Manifest keys are forward-slash install-relative, and AddonPaths.Normalize must keep emitting forward slashes (.claude/rules/addons.md)."
        ],
