            "problem": "An intact plain Repair stamps LastKnownVersion = EffectiveGitHubTag without laying that version down.",
            "impact": "A GitHubReleases install that is behind (or pinned to an older tag) is marked as the latest after a no-op repair. The Update CTA disappears (CurrentVersion IS LastKnownVersion), the pin stops matching, and manifest.Version and the config disagree until the next release.",
            "evidence": "MainWindow.xaml.cs:8190-8196 (intact, nothing laid), 8440-8445 (unconditional stamp), 10434-10437; UpdateService.cs:403, 491-493"
