        "openQuestions": [
          "What should a plain Repair target for GitHubReleases: the installed/pinned tag (a true repair) or the effective latest (the 'reinstale todo junto con las actualizaciones' model)? This decides whether the intact-path stamp fix just keeps LastKnownVersion or triggers an update, and whether a pin must be honoured.",
