            "claim": "IsCleanAoE3Folder rejects a folder with a root install-manifest.json or any known mod marker. The fast path of AoE3Detector.FindAll does not apply it; InstallationFromManualRoot and the FindAllDeep content scan do",
            "evidence": "AoE3Detector.cs:489-510, 37-183, 524-533, 567-597",
            "verified": true
