          },
          {
            "problem": "Repair has no ownership veto of its own, the way uninstall does.",
            "impact": "If the install path ever resolves to another mod's folder, a GitHubReleases repair would lay this mod's payload there and delete the other mod's net-new files through ApplyUpdateDeletions. Detection's ForeignInstall check is the only protection. PLAUSIBLE: defense in depth.",
