            "impact": "If the check that closes a running game before repair (EnsureGameNotRunning) matches by process name, it can close the wrong mod. PLAUSIBLE, not traced. An exe-probe with no marker is the misdetection shape that once led the launcher to uninstall the wrong mod.",
            "evidence": "catalog-cache.json (IM no marker); kings-return last manifest (git 4468bea^); MainWindow.xaml.cs:10039-10076; docs/MODDING.md:337-338"
          }
