            "evidence": "git show 8767ab2 -- CLAUDE.md (hunk @@ -361,22 +362,59): '(the maintainer's explicit model: \"reinstale todo junto con las actualizaciones\")'; CLAUDE.md:697-722 today",
            "verified": true
          },
          {
            "claim": "The removed granular branch returned early when intact (skipping the post-finally pending-update continuation), passed null phase/extract/overlay progress (bar froze), discarded the RepairResult (unrepairable list ignored), and did not rewrite the manifest.",
