            "verified": true
          },
          {
            "claim": "Granular RepairFilesAsync copied the BASE payload's bytes over damaged files, while the same commit made UpdateService re-capture FileHashes after WoL patches; a damaged patched file would be restored to the wrong (pre-patch) version.",
            "evidence": "8767ab2 diff: srcFile = Path.Combine(extractedFolder, relNative); File.Copy(srcFile, destPath, overwrite:true). 64bd61d diff of UpdateService.cs adds RecaptureHashes(touchedByPatches) merged into manifest.FileHashes after patches",
            "verified": true
          },
          {
            "claim": "The progress panel that hosts the Verify error message and the Retry(=Repair) button is inside a Collapsed container and is not mirrored to the visible dashboard strip, so the Verify->Repair handoff is invisible.",
            "evidence": "MainWindow.xaml:1596-1611 (LegacyPlayContent Visibility=Collapsed contains ProgressPanelControl); MainWindow.xaml.cs:4144-4206 mirrors title/step/speed/eta/percent/bar/pause/cancel only; grep shows ProgressActionRetry/ProgressMessageText referenced only in ProgressPanel.xaml and ShowProgress* (9715-9788); hidden since 7f819bc v0.9.4 2026-05-25",
            "verified": true
          },
          {
            "claim": "Verify shows damaged files only as a count plus the first 10 names in the status line (a collapsed stub, visible later only as the idle dashboard subtitle) and the full list only in the diagnostic log.",
            "evidence": "MainWindow.xaml.cs:7757-7770; SetStatus 13166-13198 (PaintIdleStatusLine writes only when Idle); Controls/MainTabs.xaml:37-42 StatusText Collapsed",
            "verified": true
          },
          {
            "claim": "Verify's report and Repair's pre-verify use different checks: Verify includes structural probes + engine files; Repair's pre-verify is VerifyAgainstManifest (overlay only). Engine-only or probe-only damage makes Verify report N problems while Repair says 'Installation intact — nothing to repair'.",
            "evidence": "VerifyInstallation MainWindow.xaml.cs:10112-10150, 10246-10253 vs RepairInstallAsync 8185-8197",
            "verified": true
          },
          {
