            "evidence": "NativeInstallService.cs:626 WriteManifest(..., aoe3SourcePath: null, clonedAoe3: false, ...) vs 794-797 (previousManifest.Aoe3SourcePath, previousManifest.ClonedAoe3); UninstallService.cs:183-197, 347-348; MultiInstallPhase1Tests.Plan_InPlaceOverlay_IsOverlayOnly_NotBlanketDelete",
