          {
            "claim": "For GitHubReleases, a plain repair of a damaged install re-lays the EFFECTIVE (approved/latest) tag, not the installed or pinned version; PinnedVersion is only touched when targetReleaseTag != null.",
            "evidence": "EnsurePayloadAsync -> ResolvePayloadUrlsAsync(overrideTag: null) -> EffectiveGitHubTag MainWindow.xaml.cs:10341-10343; ResolveInstallVersion 10434-10437; pin logic 8457-8464; UpdateService.ResolveEffectiveGitHubTag 728-734 ignores the pin",
            "verified": true
