            "evidence": "MainWindow.xaml.cs:8180 (Done/Total*0.2) vs 8077 ((p.Percentage/100)*weightDownload)",
            "verified": true
          },
          {
            "claim": "Elevation for repair relaunches without a resume argument, so the user must press Repair again and the multi-minute verify runs twice; an '--update-now' resume precedent exists.",
            "evidence": "EnsureInstallWritableOrElevate 8629-8663 calls ElevationService.RelaunchElevated() with no args (8651); update path RelaunchElevated(\"--update-now\") 8739; handled at 614-618; ElevationService.cs:64-69",
            "verified": true
          },
          {
