            "evidence": "ConfirmRepairSpaceOk MainWindow.xaml.cs:7496-7498; DiskSpaceService.cs:40 RepairAllowanceBytes = 3*GiB, :49 OverlayHeadroomBytes = 1*GiB",
            "verified": true
          },
          {
            "claim": "Because a plain repair skips when the overlay verifies intact, idempotent convergence steps (clone-file removal, superseded .XMB removal) never run on an old install; this is why v1.0.14s says old installs are not fixed by Repair.",
            "evidence": "RemoveCloneFilesRemovedByPatches runs only inside InstallModOnlyAsync (NativeInstallService.cs:610-611, 2124-2154; added ba31517 2026-09-24); intact branch MainWindow.xaml.cs:8190-8197; releases/v1.0.14s.md:10-12; WoL list ModRegistry.cs:960-966 (10 files)",
            "verified": true
