          {
            "claim": "The immediate-exit toast has no action buttons, checks existence only, and says 'Your files are fine' even though corrupt or engine files are not checked; it sweeps the displayed mod's install path, not the launched one.",
            "evidence": "MainWindow.xaml.cs:12500 (_updateService?.InstallPath), 12513-12543 (Array.Empty<ToastAction>()); InstallSnapshot.cs:242-273 existence-only; Strings.cs:8063-8087; AppToast.ToastAction exists (Controls/AppToast.cs:31)",
