          {
            "claim": "CLAUDE.md states the host has no per-file URLs, and that the launcher's byte-faithful WoL payload never MD5-matches any UpdateInfo.xml version.",
            "evidence": "CLAUDE.md:715, 771-773; UpdateService.cs:1513-1518 comment. Not checked against real payload or UpdateInfo data.",
