          {
            "claim": "Test classes touching verify/repair/manifest/hash/payload and what they pin: VerifyServiceTests (SHA pin, missing/corrupt classification, size-first, covered files verified against the _originals snapshot or skipped without one, PruneMissingHashes, manifest round-trip, deterministic parallel order, engine split, progress bytes, FindUnexpectedFiles, RecaptureHashes); PayloadIntegrityTests (VerifyExtractIntact is a no-op when intact; a vanished file raises PayloadFileBlockedException); DirectPayloadInstallTests (wrapper stripping, direct == staged output, hashes match the disk, duplicate entries recorded once, zip-slip rejected, OverlayBaseline, ValidatePayloadZip); InstallSnapshotTests (CountMissingFiles 0 vs null); ManifestRecognitionTests (RecognizeFromManifestData baseline/drift/migration); DeltaPatchTests (ResolveDeltaTarget: a plain repair never patches; PreVerify; delta equals full result); DeltaChainPlannerTests (rescue/baseline); OverlayDeletionTests (sticky net-new, auto-delete, delete.lst); InstallParityTests (delete list, clone cleanup, superseded XMB); AddonServiceTests/AddonOwnershipTests (fingerprint re-capture so Verify stays clean, fresh backup on re-apply); UninstallSafetyTests/MultiInstallPhase1Tests (ShouldRemoveOverlayOnly, cloned vs in-place); FilesAndAntivirusDialogTests (blocked mode cannot be silenced, stock game hides Repair); DiskSpaceServiceTests; DownloadRetryTests; ReplaceDestinationTests; CatalogPayloadOverlayTests (WoL payload override needs SHA pins); ModHashServiceTests; StaleOriginalsFallbackTests; ModVersionFingerprintTests. None cover RepairInstallAsync, VerifyInstallation, InstallModOnlyAsync or WriteManifest.",
            "evidence": "method listings of those files in WarsOfLibertyLauncher.Tests; grep for VerifyInstallation|InstallModOnlyAsync|WriteManifest in the tests finds only unrelated local helpers (LocalManifestTests, ModInstallProbeTests, MultiInstallPhase1Tests)",
