          {
            "claim": "Several comments still describe the removed granular repair and mislead future work.",
            "evidence": "NativeInstallService.cs:1868-1869 ('repairable by the granular re-copy'), 2610 ('granular Repair resurrect'); VerifyService.cs:231, 239; VerifyServiceTests.cs:14; MainWindow.xaml.cs:10220 ('which Repair then re-copies selectively'); CLAUDE.md:808",
